    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKSJyfM8AAAABDMrIlA",
      "title": "Version Packages",
      "author": "opgitgovernance",
      "number": 1023,
      "body": "This PR was opened by the [Changesets release](https://github.com/changesets/action) GitHub action. When you're ready to do a release, you can merge this and the packages will be published to npm automatically. If you're not ready to do a release yet, that's fine, whenever you add more changesets to main, this PR will be updated.\n\n\n# Releases\n## @eth-optimism/autorelayer-interop@0.0.27\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   Updated dependencies \\[[`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b)]:\n    -   @eth-optimism/viem@0.4.16\n\n## @eth-optimism/ponder-interop@0.0.25\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   Updated dependencies \\[[`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b)]:\n    -   @eth-optimism/viem@0.4.16\n\n## supersim@0.1.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   [#1022](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/pull/1022) [`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b) Thanks [@jefr90](https://github.com/jefr90)! - bump to 0.1.0-alpha.60\n\n## @eth-optimism/viem@0.4.16\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   [#1022](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/pull/1022) [`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b) Thanks [@jefr90](https://github.com/jefr90)! - forward gas parameters through simulateRelayCrossDomainMessage\n\n    It only read account, id, payload and accessList, so callers could not set a gas\n    price. CrossL2Inbox rejects relayMessage when tx.gasprice is 0 and basefee is\n    not, which made the action unusable on any chain with a non-zero basefee.\n\n## @eth-optimism/wagmi@0.1.15\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   Updated dependencies \\[[`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b)]:\n    -   @eth-optimism/viem@0.4.16\n\n## @eth-optimism/sponsored-sender@0.0.14\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   Updated dependencies \\[[`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b)]:\n    -   @eth-optimism/viem@0.4.16\n\n## @eth-optimism/superchain-playground@0.0.9\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n-   Updated dependencies \\[[`eac3e7d`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/ecosystem/commit/eac3e7d5b3dde76879efaa27df23a10da4406d6b)]:\n    -   @eth-optimism/viem@0.4.16\n    -   @eth-optimism/wagmi@0.1.15\n",
